  "canon:title": "Seizure and delirium secondary to carboplatin and pantoprazole therapy-induced hypomagnesemia in a cancer patient.",
  "canon:abstract": "Active surveillance and treatment of hypomagnesemia along with strict avoidance of concurrent offending agents is essential to prevent its grave clinical consequences among patients on carboplatin therapy.",
  "canon:text": "Seizure and delirium secondary to carboplatin and pantoprazole therapy-induced hypomagnesemia in a cancer patient. Active surveillance and treatment of hypomagnesemia along with strict avoidance of concurrent offending agents is essential to prevent its grave clinical consequences among patients on carboplatin therapy.",
